OL,3,AHurricane Polo makes landfall on
OL,4,AMexico's Pacific coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FHurricane Polo has made landfall along
OL,7,Fthe northern Pacific coast of Mexico,
OL,8,Flashing the state of Baja California
OL,9,FSur with life-threatening winds and
OL,10,Fheavy rain that has already flooded
OL,11,Fsome coastal areas.
OL,13,FMexican officials said Polo moved
OL,14,Fashore just south of the surfing and
OL,15,Ffishing village of Las Barrancas
OL,16,Fbringing maximum sustained winds of 110
OL,17,Fmph (175 km/h).
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
