OL,3,AHurricane Polo makes landfall on
OL,4,AMexico's Pacific coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolo is moving northeast and on the
OL,7,Fforecast track, its core is predicted
OL,8,Fto continue passing over Baja
OL,9,FCalifornia Sur before moving inland
OL,10,Fover the southern part of the Mexican
OL,11,Fstate of Sonora later on Tuesday.
OL,13,FResidents in threatened areas have been
OL,14,Fencouraged to seek shelter.
